LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (../comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task



#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#----------------------------- General setting -------------------------------
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
clear
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (../comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#---------------------------- Importing atoms --------------------------------
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
read_data cubic400.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (4.1844066 5.0243022 4.1908196) to (22.639783 25.586258 22.862247)
  2 by 4 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  400 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.007 seconds
# replicate 2 2 2

#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#-------------------- Grouping for MSD calculations---------------------------
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
group F type 1
200 atoms in group F
group Li type 2
93 atoms in group Li
group Na type 3
23 atoms in group Na
group K type 4
84 atoms in group K

#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#------------------------- Interatomic Potential -----------------------------
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
pair_style mlip mlip.ini
pair_coeff * *

#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#----------------------------- Other Settings --------------------------------
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
variable T1 equal 800
variable T2 equal 600
variable P equal 0
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 1 check yes
dump mydmp all atom 50 dump${T1}_${T2}.lammpstrj
dump mydmp all atom 50 dump800_${T2}.lammpstrj
dump mydmp all atom 50 dump800_600.lammpstrj
log log${T1}_${T2}.lammps
log log800_${T2}.lammps
log log800_600.lammps
